ECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwitmZTZ8tSWAxWmj68BHePVCl0Q3IcHCIsBKAc",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["[補發]\n裝潢完後味道完全跑掉了，非常可惜\n下圖兩碗是一摸一樣的品項、濃度，各位可以自行比較\n\n原本以前的愛店，裝潢完隔一天便迫不及待的跑去吃結果卻十分令人失望，麵體的硬度大概是唯一有維持的東西。\n\n湯的濃度淡到我以為點錯了，還再向店員確認一次，店員表示這是最濃的沒有錯；店員原本是有問我要不要換一碗，但當下真的太餓就婉拒了。(而且已經最濃了，換了應該還是一樣吧)\n\n溏心蛋的熟度過往都是咬下去，蛋黃都是整個流出來的，現在蛋黃卻變成7-8分熟(固體狀)。\n\n蘿蔔絲直接沒了。\n\n湯的熱度從過去上來是熱騰騰到會有點燙到嘴巴的程度變成了溫溫的。\n\n價格從關店前的250漲至300。\n\n優點也是有的，但不多，肉變多了、空間變大變明亮了。\n但我覺得優點整體沒辦法補足上面的缺點。\n\n給一顆星緬懷一下以前的壹之穴",null,[0,46]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRaTWxwR2JGVlRSM040VDBWV05sUkZXakJqVldoSVZraHdTR015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRaTWxwR2JGVlRSM040VDBWV05sUkZXakJqVldoSVZraHdTR015WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRaTWxwR2JGVlRSM040VDBWV05sUkZXakJqVldoSVZraHdTR015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRaTWxwR2JGVlRSM040VDBWV05sUkZXakJqVldoSVZraHdTR015WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRaTWxwR2JGVlRSM040VDBWV05sUkZXakJqVldoSVZraHdTR015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11576539548184271884/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRaTWxwR2JGVlRSM040VDBWV05sUkZXakJqVldoSVZraHdTR015WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,18082,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tZMlpGbFVTR3N4T0VWNlRFWjBjVWhIVkhwSGMyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1c5b1c90785e9e10!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkY2ZFlUSGsxOEV6TEZ0cUhHVHpHc2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["ht